{"title":"This Is Your Captain Speaking&#8230;","link":"https://kottke.org/25/06/this-is-your-captain-speaking","date":1748873621000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/ferry-waves.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/ferry-waves.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/ferry-waves.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"937\" alt=\"waves created in the wake of a ferry boat\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hey, folks. I just wanted to let you know that I’m going to be away from the site for a couple of weeks for a family vacation. No guest editor or anything…just going off the air for a much needed rest. Wishing everyone well and I will see you in mid-June.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/kottke.org\">kottke.org</a></p>\n\n        \n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"9856f7cb11dce2ad196eb0787e7f65506249d82bb98a95b8642af28ece20361a","category":"Sites"}